project/progressive-bake-serve: spoint bakes source GLBs to LOCAL_progressive on demand (src/static/ProgressiveBake.js getProgressive/ensureProgressive, .progressive-cache content-hash keyed) served via StaticHandler <model>.glb.prog/model.progressive.glb + /lods/* route. server.js prewarmProgressive bakes world model entities at startup so client probe finds them ready. ModelPool consumes the baked progressive asset.